<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-songshu" book-id="b-songshu-006" chapter-id="c-songshu-006-yinshuyi-ziluan-ranks" source-id="s-songshu-006-yinshuyi-ziluan-ranks-ws2310150">
  <p id="c-songshu-006-yinshuyi-ziluan-ranks:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">第八皇子<persName id="c-songshu-006-yinshuyi-ziluan-ranks:p001:m0004" ref="9b9_9ba_01d">子鸞</persName>為襄陽王。</p>
  <p id="c-songshu-006-yinshuyi-ziluan-ranks:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">丁亥，改封襄陽王<persName id="c-songshu-006-yinshuyi-ziluan-ranks:p002:m0008" ref="9b9_9ba_01d">子鸞</persName>為新安王。</p>
  <p id="c-songshu-006-yinshuyi-ziluan-ranks:p003" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">乙卯，以東中郎將新安王<persName id="c-songshu-006-yinshuyi-ziluan-ranks:p003:m0011" ref="9b9_9ba_01d">子鸞</persName>為南徐州刺史。</p>
  <p id="c-songshu-006-yinshuyi-ziluan-ranks:p004" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">庚寅，南徐州刺史新安王<persName id="c-songshu-006-yinshuyi-ziluan-ranks:p004:m0011" ref="9b9_9ba_01d">子鸞</persName>兼司徒。</p>
  <p id="c-songshu-006-yinshuyi-ziluan-ranks:p005" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">南徐州刺史新安王<persName id="c-songshu-006-yinshuyi-ziluan-ranks:p005:m0008" ref="9b9_9ba_01d">子鸞</persName>為撫軍將軍，領司徒、刺史如故</p>
</text>
